runs/20261007-companion-priority/pbps-b4-perturbation-preproof72/independent-header-math72/input05.review-guidance.raw.md:14: trailing whitespace.
+1. **Lean truth:** the pinned declaration compiles without fake closure.
runs/20261007-companion-priority/pbps-b4-perturbation-preproof72/independent-header-math72/input05.review-guidance.raw.md:15: trailing whitespace.
+2. **Reconstruction evidence:** an independent decoder reconstructs the theorem from the Lean statement while source text, source identity, theorem number, prior audit, and repair proposals are hidden.
runs/20261007-companion-priority/pbps-b4-perturbation-preproof72/independent-header-math72/input05.review-guidance.raw.md:16: trailing whitespace.
+3. **Source fidelity:** an independent source reviewer compares the original and reconstruction slot by slot using a packet-bound review run.
runs/20261007-companion-priority/pbps-b4-perturbation-preproof72/independent-header-math72/input05.review-guidance.raw.md:17: trailing whitespace.
+4. **Repair status:** a proposed denoising repair remains an overlay until a separate exact-proposal repair review accepts it. It never overwrites the pinned source theorem automatically.
runs/20261007-companion-priority/pbps-b4-perturbation-preproof72/independent-header-math72/input05.review-guidance.raw.md:18: trailing whitespace.
+
