+(2.6), and we set  $\mathfrak{H}\coloneqq L^{2}(\pi_{\eta})$ . Recall from
runs/20261007-companion-priority/pbps-b4-perturbation-preproof72/independent-header-source72/stageA-read-supplement72.stdout.exactraw.txt:60: trailing whitespace.
+(3.11) that the ideal Proximal BPS has
runs/20261007-companion-priority/pbps-b4-perturbation-preproof72/independent-header-source72/stageA-read-supplement72.stdout.exactraw.txt:61: trailing whitespace.
+transition kernel
runs/20261007-companion-priority/pbps-b4-perturbation-preproof72/independent-header-source72/stageA-read-supplement72.stdout.exactraw.txt:62: trailing whitespace.
+
runs/20261007-companion-priority/pbps-b4-perturbation-preproof72/independent-header-source72/stageA-read-supplement72.stdout.exactraw.txt:63: trailing whitespace.
+SUPPLEMENT PARAGRAPH A2.SS1.p1.2
runs/20261007-companion-priority/pbps-b4-perturbation-preproof72/independent-header-source72/stageA-read-supplement72.stdout.exactraw.txt:64: trailing whitespace.
+where  $\mathcal{H}_{y^{\prime}}$  is the conditional half-turn kernel from
